# bundle is built into brew; https://docs.brew.sh/Brew-Bundle-and-Brewfile

# ```sh
# brew bundle install --global
# ```
#
# Leaves only: a formula that another entry depends on is not listed (brew keeps
# it as that entry's dependency). Check with `brew leaves` against this file.

# Role: on the desk MacBook Pro (chezmoi host mac-pro) this file gains the
# heavy, desk-only block at the end; every other Mac (mac-air, the travel
# MacBook Air) gets the subset. The role is chezmoi data, not an environment
# variable, so `brew bundle cleanup --global --force` always reads the block the
# host was set up with. README "Mac roles".

